==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gmh|gegen}}, from {{der|de|goh|gagan}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*gagina}}. Compare {{cog|is|gegn}}, {{cog|nl|tegen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɡe.ɡən/|[ˈɡeː.ɡn̩]|[ˈɡeː.ɡŋ̍]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-gegen.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

===Preposition===
{{head|de|preposition}} {{label|de|+ accusative}}

# [[against]]

====Usage notes====
* Like in Middle High German, ''gegen'' was also used with dative in older times, especially in ''Upper German''.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|de|wider}}

